          "end": 16.02,
          "en": "we have talked about data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 16.02,
          "end": 16.853,
          "en": "And we also mentioned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 16.853,
          "end": 18.27,
          "en": "that in the software industry,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
