        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 33.09,
          "end": 34.47,
          "en": "for the permanent storage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 34.47,
          "end": 36.6,
          "en": "But the thing is, it's all about data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 36.6,
          "end": 38.22,
          "en": "And whenever we use any language,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 38.22,
          "end": 40.29,
          "en": "it doesn't matter which language you use,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 40.29,
          "end": 42.87,
          "en": "what you do is you store that data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 42.87,
          "end": 44.19,
          "en": "in your code somewhere.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 44.19,
          "end": 45.45,
          "en": "And to store that data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 45.45,
          "end": 47.67,
          "en": "we use something called a variable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 47.67,
          "end": 49.83,
          "en": "Now, imagine variable as a box",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 49.83,
          "end": 52.89,
          "en": "and you are keeping your data inside that box.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 52.89,
          "end": 54.15,
          "en": "The problem is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 54.15,
          "end": 56.37,
          "en": "every box need to have a type.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 56.37,
          "end": 57.3,
          "en": "Of course, there are languages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 57.3,
          "end": 59.13,
          "en": "which are the dynamically-typed language",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 59.13,
          "end": 61.05,
          "en": "where you don't actually mention",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 61.05,
          "end": 62.22,
          "en": "the type of the variable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 62.22,
          "end": 65.28,
          "en": "But in general, this box will have a type.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 65.28,
          "end": 67.83,
          "en": "So that means if you want to store the data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 67.83,
          "end": 69.72,
          "en": "you need a box, which is your variable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 69.72,
          "end": 72.24,
          "en": "And this variable also needs a type to it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 72.24,
          "end": 75.03,
          "en": "or this box needs a type to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 75.03,
          "end": 77.22,
          "en": "Now example, let's say, if you want to store a number,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 77.22,
          "end": 79.02,
          "en": "so we can use something called an integer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 79.02,
          "end": 81.53999999999999,
          "en": "or if you have any other point values,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 81.53999999999999,
          "end": 83.82,
          "en": "you can also use float or double.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 83.82,
          "end": 86.25,
          "en": "Now, it depends upon of the languages how they work,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 86.25,
          "end": 87.75,
          "en": "but in most of the languages,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 87.75,
          "end": 88.77,
          "en": "we have something in common.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 88.77,
          "end": 91.28999999999999,
          "en": "We have integer for the normal numbers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 91.28999999999999,
          "end": 94.32,
          "en": "we have a float for the point values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 94.32,
          "end": 96.21000000000001,
          "en": "And what if you want to store a text?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 96.21000000000001,
          "end": 97.74000000000001,
          "en": "That's why we have string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 97.74000000000001,
          "end": 99.42,
          "en": "And in few languages,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 99.42,
          "end": 101.1,
          "en": "we don't have all these types,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 101.1,
          "end": 102.81,
          "en": "we have limited types,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 102.81,
          "end": 104.91,
          "en": "and in other languages we have many.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 104.91,
          "end": 105.96000000000001,
          "en": "But that doesn't matter, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 105.96000000000001,
          "end": 108.15,
          "en": "In general, we'll be having a variable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 108.15,
          "end": 109.25999999999999,
          "en": "and a type to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 109.25999999999999,
          "end": 111.66,
          "en": "Now, all these type are called datatypes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 111.66,
          "end": 115.05,
          "en": "and they are the system defined datatypes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
