          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 117.06,
          "end": 119.00999999999999,
          "en": "is because it's there in the language itself,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 119.00999999999999,
          "end": 120.57,
          "en": "you can directly use them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 120.57,
          "end": 124.26,
          "en": "But sometime, you want to use some complex datatype,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 124.26,
          "end": 125.28,
          "en": "and we can create that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 125.28,
          "end": 126.75,
          "en": "with the help of some other concepts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 126.75,
          "end": 129.54,
          "en": "Example, let's say, if you want to represent a human",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 129.54,
          "end": 131.16,
          "en": "or if you want to represent a phone.",
