        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 141.75,
          "end": 143.7,
          "en": "Then brand, then the configuration,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 143.7,
          "end": 145.38,
          "en": "the amount of CPU, RAM.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 145.38,
          "end": 147.81,
          "en": "All this are your data, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 147.81,
          "end": 148.92000000000002,
          "en": "So if you want to represent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 148.92000000000002,
          "end": 151.41,
          "en": "any physical thing in the virtual world,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 151.41,
          "end": 153.78,
          "en": "we use objects there, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 153.78,
          "end": 154.82999999999998,
          "en": "Now, in some languages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 154.82999999999998,
          "end": 156.03,
          "en": "which are object oriented programming,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 156.03,
          "end": 157.77,
          "en": "we do that with the help of objects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 157.77,
          "end": 161.04,
          "en": "Example, in C, we use something called structures.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 161.04,
          "end": 163.38,
          "en": "So we can define a structure name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 163.38,
          "end": 164.34,
