        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 185.07,
          "end": 187.59,
          "en": "we are defining our own type, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 187.59,
          "end": 190.41,
          "en": "So that's about data and datatypes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
